WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.430
Here, Mikihisa...

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.880
Say "ah"...

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.200
Thanks, it was delicious.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:17.130
This is the first time we've gone on a trip alone together, isn't it?

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.190
Wasn't your family concerned?

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.170
No...

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.210
I told my mom that I was going with another girl,

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:30.120
but when she sees a picture of us together, I bet she'll be in for a shock.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.260
I wonder...

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.380
Probably...

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.040
No, I'm sure of it.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:37.980
Satomi...

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:43.400
Let's make this a Christmas Eve we'll never forget.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:44.870
Yeah...

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.420
This time, for sure...

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.170
She's coming...

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.890
Currently, on the Earth,

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:06.170
there are hundreds of different alien species coming and going, living out their lives.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.540
Species that come in peace...

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:10.400
Aggressive species...

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:15.520
Different aliens with all sorts of demeanors live among us, maintaining a precarious balance.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:19.600
And, right now... Earth is being targeted!

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:31.610
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:36.570
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:41.560
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:47.040
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:52.130
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:57.470
I'm feeling nauseous

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:07.860
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:18.030
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:28.330
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:38.760
Cold finger girl

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.910
Sit Down

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:58.570
What did you say?!

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:03.050
It seems like Princess Saki of the Macbac race is coming to Earth.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.570
She'll be arriving tomorrow, on Christmas Eve.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:11.880
Macbac? Aren't they the race that's all female?

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.710
This is some Santa Claus we got coming.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:20.040
They are not a race inclined to hand out presents to children.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.850
They said they're here for first-hand observation, however...

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:24.970
She's after a groom, right?

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:26.550
Most likely.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.400
Please don't tell me she's entered mating season...

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:36.560
The only member of the Macbac race who can reproduce is the queen.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:41.650
Because of that, their race has a society which resembles that of a certain species of insect.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.340
When they enter mating season,

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:48.400
the queen begins searching for a male husband from another alien race.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:55.040
The queen mates with the one she falls in love with only once, and gives birth to a child.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:04:00.310
And it is said she lives together happily with him until the death of her partner.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.870
My, how romantic...

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:07.170
Love between two races is a marvelous thing.

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:09.040
The problem begins afterwards.

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.510
The Macbac race.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:13.520
Also known as Heterocarnis.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.070
The race chosen by that queen...

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:20.390
...is always completely wiped out in a few generations!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.300
Welcome to Earth, Princess Saki.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:43.330
We will be your guides.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.630
We are from the planet Dogura.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.690
Nice to meet you.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:48.090
We are in your hands.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:53.060
If I may, this place is quite cold.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:57.230
I was hoping to meet the Earthlings as soon as I could, so...

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.080
Most Earthlings are unaware of aliens flying in.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.770
That is why we ensured you landed where you would not be witnessed.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.060
My...

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:08.700
Then we must hide our antennae, wings, and ship, yes?

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:11.410
Your reasoning is most correct.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.900
In that case, we will go to change.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:15.650
Please wait a moment.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.860
You think a miniskirt would be good?

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:18.640
Oh, no way!

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.200
Your thighs are too fat for that, Saki!

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.210
And you walk bowlegged...

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.310
How cruel, you two!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.580
They seem like normal girls.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:24.510
Where's the "yes, Princess" huh?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.790
I was thinking they'd be scarier.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.190
Don't let your guard down.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.750
Thinking about it from a ecological perspective,

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:32.740
they should be adept at wheedling their way into their mark's society.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:36.180
They get close to others by putting on an innocent face, but they're the aggressors here.

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:38.380
Oh, come on, you two.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:41.230
The Prince's poison must have rubbed off too much on you!

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:42.970
So young.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.070
Speaking of which... Where is that idiot?

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.350
Please tell me you didn't say anything to him about this!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.580
Of course not.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.300
He should be in South-East Asia right now collecting herbal medicines...

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.600
It's not nice to get in the way of mating.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:03.700
Mating?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.650
I'm sorry the road is so beat up.

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:12.050
I don't mind in the slightest.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.780
Captain, if we went back on the road we came in on...

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.850
Speak in Earth language when talking among ourselves!

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:22.440
Are you all right?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.190
Y-Yes! Perfectly fine!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:28.320
I know you came a long way... Starting your journey off like this must be disappointing.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:29.540
No...

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.080
I've been looking forward to coming to Earth for a long time, so...

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.030
It is said that the Macbac race has destroyed thousands of planets.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:42.710
The reason they are destroyed is that the males lose the ability to reproduce.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.320
I thought the queen only mated with a single individual...

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.460
So why would all of the race's males...

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:53.090
The most convincing explanation is by transmission of a virus.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:57.770
The most perilous thing about interbreeding between races is unknown diseases.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:03.480
As a defense mechanism, it is believed that inside the queen are countless viruses.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:08.930
And among them, a virus programmed to destroy the male's ability to reproduce.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.350
When the virus is transmitted through bodily fluids to the male,

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.200
it immediately changes to a type spread through airborne transmission.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:19.800
Shortly thereafter, it covers the entire planet

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:23.400
and castrates all the ones labeled as male by their chromosomes.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.080
This is nothing to laugh about.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:29.960
I don't believe it.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:32.070
Why would they do such a thing?

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.420
They must be extremely jealous.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:37.300
It makes sure that they can never be cheated on.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.240
That's an old line of lonely academics.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:43.270
As members of the Earth Defense Task Force, what is it that we can do?

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.270
Match-unmaking!

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:49.000
What is it?

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.080
Oh, nothing.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.530
I was just thinking how it really wasn't needed for you to come all the way out to Earth...

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:57.570
It's got to have some of the worst environmental destruction in the galaxy.

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:01.580
They just dump hazardous waste anywhere, and release huge amounts of carbon dioxide!

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:02.740
Illegal dumping...

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.790
Basically, they leave the shit they dump out as someone else's problem!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:10.260
Um, it sounds like you're only telling me the bad points...

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.960
Don't they have some redeeming qualities?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:16.070
As a strength, you could say that they have a fierce appetite for breeding.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:18.110
They get sexually aroused no matter what season...

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.350
Men and women think only about mating.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.520
It's okay, right?

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.430
I-I don't mind...

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:29.890
It's okay, it's just...

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:32.600
Sorry, I was a little shocked, is all.

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:36.770
I wanted to spend the night tonight in the same bed as you, Satomi.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.060
Mikihisa...

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:46.530
Ooh! It's so beautiful!

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:47.660
Yeah!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.460
Take a look, Saki!

00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:51.920
Look at the doll in the red suit!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:53.310
Is it okay for them to be using alien language?

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.310
How cute!

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.130
I wanna take it home with me!

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:56.340
I'm sure everyone will just think they're from some foreign country.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.240
Is today some kind of festival?

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.430
It's called Christmas Eve.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:04.350
More mating happens tonight than at any other time.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.640
C-Captain!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:07.650
It's not like I'm wrong about that.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.500
Well, true, but...

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:15.530
On Earth, it is common for one person to have many different partners during their lifetime.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:19.230
This bunch will surely end up with some other partners next year.

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.990
Is that so...

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.170
You're going too far, Captain!

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:25.920
Don't be such a stiff!

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.620
If we can get them to hate the planet, all the better!

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.140
Please, don't let it get to you, Saki.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:34.680
It's true that some couples are like that, but not all of them!

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:35.920
That's nice to hear!

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:37.830
Why that little...

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.410
Whose side is he on?

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.160
Satomi...

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.430
You can check out whenever you'd like.

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:49.310
If you'd like to go home, just ask.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:52.100
I intend to work as hard as I can during my stay here.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.690
It will be difficult.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:57.590
I think that breeding like the humans, where you mate without regard to your partner,

00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:00.490
may be better for reproductive purposes.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:05.970
However, I believe this to be a trial handed down to me by my ancestors.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:10.450
A once in a lifetime love on which hangs the survival of our entire race...

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:14.210
That is why, indeed, I must search with all my might,

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.540
and put my entire soul into this intermingling.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:21.170
I feel pride in the traditions of my Macbac race.

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:23.180
And if you cannot find a partner?

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:24.220
I will find one.

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:26.220
And if that partner will not accept you?

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:28.350
I will make him, through hard work.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:32.490
It's also possible he'll be impotent or sterile.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:34.280
He could have a mother complex, be a lolicon, or a homosexual!

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.100
Maybe he'll turn you down 'cause he can only love 2D!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:42.820
I have the confidence to overcome all the hurdles in order to preserve my race.

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.290
Sorry, but I can't assist you.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.650
Our personalities are at odds.

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:49.490
Captain!

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:53.410
I like people who are straightforward.

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:56.000
What the hell is with her?

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.320
She's just passionate.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.200
Passionate, how?!

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.010
But please, show her more respect.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.530
This can only serve to sour the relationship between Macbac and Dogura.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.470
I don't care!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.050
I'm pretty sure they already hate us!

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:11.310
Satomi!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.470
Wait!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.770
I just can't!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.360
Why?

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:19.940
I just... I can only see you as a friend.

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.070
No matter what?

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.320
I see...

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:25.480
I'm sorry.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.800
I'm going home!

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:27.700
Satomi!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:31.030
The woman was at fault here, yes?

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:32.870
No, the man is to blame.

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.550
Who gives a crap?!

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:36.740
I feel like the moment the reservation was placed at the hotel,

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:39.980
it would have been obvious the purpose was carnal relations...

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:44.270
So what? You're saying we have to sleep with the Macbac girls?

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.610
With them...

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.320
We are in danger.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.240
No need to worry.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:52.760
I'll shoot the bastard before we Dogurians are doomed.

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:00.940
Was it too soon, maybe?

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:05.520
I apologize... I don't understand even one word of Earth language.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.770
Well, this is my job.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:10.320
No...

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.290
Do you have any request for meals?

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:17.250
It's not a matter of time, is it?

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.100
Princess Saki?

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:49.390
Marry me, please!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.720
P-Princess Saki!

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:07.210
Are you out of your mind?

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:08.920
No, I am very certain!

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:11.340
This person is the one, no mistake!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.210
What? Just like that?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:18.090
My name is Mikihisa. What did you just...

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:19.150
Wait, hold it!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.190
Stay back, you!

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:21.820
I'm not anyone suspicious!

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.130
Please, introduce her to me!

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.570
Please, act as my interpreter!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.440
Tell him what I said!

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.010
Both of them?

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.530
Bingo?!

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:35.270
Why'd it have to be like this?!

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:43.530
For now, let us have a calm conversation...

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.350
What did she say before?!

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.950
I said calm, damn it! Calm!

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:58.450
She is a princess of a certain country, who is taking a vacation here in secret.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:01.260
We are the princess's bodyguards.

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:03.490
A princess?

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:06.540
So far, so good, Captain.

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.650
It sounds more believable to mix in a bit of truth.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:15.230
Plus, revealing that she is a princess should amp up the pressure considerably.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.010
The princess just said to you...

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:19.990
Y-Yes?

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.170
She said...

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.850
...that you looked just like the brother from which she was separated at birth!

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.570
Captain!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.490
That is so incredibly cliché.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.760
But... all is good.

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.210
He is just a normal citizen, here on a vacation.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:47.190
He says that you look just like his fiancée, and that's why he was confused for a moment.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:50.140
My... What a fateful encounter!

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.310
No comment on the "fiancée" part?

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.480
Marriage and impediments go hand-in-hand.

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.190
God, nothing gets to this bitch!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:01.080
Please tell her that I wish to go out with her!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.090
Didn't you hear me?

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.320
I did.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.570
It made me very glad.

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:10.370
I can feel something within my blood about how I resemble her relative...

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:12.370
It must be fate!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.750
Don't make your own damn theories!

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.750
What are you talking about?

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:18.810
Nothing important.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.730
Please, tell her!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.800
I am sure that she feels the same way!

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.120
No.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.720
Why can't you at least tell her?

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:27.450
I said no! Now, give up!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:28.940
I refuse!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.440
This foolish kid!

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.980
The fate of your entire race depends on this!

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.470
Saki, if you would...

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.540
Pardon us for a bit.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:44.190
Even if you talk further, there won't be any agreement.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.660
I ask that you withdraw.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:48.670
Colin, take him.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:50.930
But, the princess...

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:51.710
I don't care.

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:52.610
It's an order.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:54.630
Stop it!

00:15:54.630 --> 00:15:55.120
Let me go!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.090
I said let me go!

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:00.940
And with this, the Earth is saved.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.190
What do you think Princess Saki is...

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:05.010
Going home, I'm sure!

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:10.240
I understand how you feel, but she wasn't for you.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.310
Please, give up on her.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:12.350
I will not.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.700
It's you?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.070
Escape together with me!

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:31.820
Captain...

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:34.410
I'm sorry...

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:39.470
They have quite a lot of guts, resorting to force.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.670
I guess we're doin' this the hard way!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:42.130
There they are!

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:44.300
Hold it!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.640
The best kind of man is one that shuts up and stays out of the way.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.430
The best kind of soldier never gives up!

00:16:51.430 --> 00:16:52.230
Colin, go!

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:58.850
What are you doing?

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.840
You are such a useless man!

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:02.610
A-Aww...

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.120
Princess Saki!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:08.500
Shit!

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.620
What is with those two?

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:14.230
I suspect it is what is known as love-at-first-sight.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.080
It is a method used by the Macbac race to find a husband.

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:19.670
"The second I saw the man that took my fancy,

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:22.840
it was like an electric shock rippled through my body,

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:26.090
I become entranced, and before I knew it I had proposed marriage."

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:29.390
That's what the queen a number of generations back said.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.320
Why didn't you tell me that before?

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:35.350
Well, the academic world does not consider it credible and has ignored it...

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.680
But it's exactly what just happened!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.370
It looks like the coast is clear.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.010
Let's go.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:58.920
I'm sorry. Here.

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:01.500
Thank you.

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:07.170
I don't know your language, or your situation, but I will protect you, no matter what.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:12.640
That's far enough!

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:15.480
Stop causing me this trouble!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.430
Why must you get in our way?

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:20.210
Our task is to serve as your bodyguards, Princess.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:24.980
We can't entrust you to some suspicious man we don't know.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.160
I will make her a happy woman!

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.740
And the result of that would be misfortune for all humanity!

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:31.490
Get away from the Princess!

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:33.820
What the...

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:37.370
Saki, use this!

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:39.500
Damn you, Colin... What the hell are you doing?

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:45.500
Wait!

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:46.770
Captain!

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:52.930
Why that little...

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:57.850
That brat thinks he can make a fool out of me?!

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:00.890
Everything will be fine now.

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.730
We won't let you do as you please any more!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.000
I apologize, Captain.

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:14.030
I didn't think that they would do something like that...

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.610
Remember this: Women are not to be trusted.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.420
Princess, let's go back!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.440
No!

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:27.100
I will not hand her over to you!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.170
Look here!

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:31.430
Do you even know how dangerous a romance this is?

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:35.590
Even if the world is destroyed, I don't care as long as I can be together with her!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.520
It really <i>is</i> gonna be destroyed!

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:40.580
Please stop this, Captain!

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.730
If something were to happen to Princess Saki...

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:49.830
We aren't returning anywhere until you acknowledge our relationship!

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.240
I will not accept it!

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.240
Even if the heavens do, I will never...

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.740
Are you okay?

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.540
I can't believe this...

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:08.270
I'd rather die than show my face to the Prince right now.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.670
Captain, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.840
Have you figured out where that kid came from?

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:14.780
Yes.

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:16.950
Take a look at this check-in card.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.500
W-What?!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:31.640
It's so beautiful...

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.690
This view...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:38.380
I wanted to show it to the person most important to me.

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:41.470
And now, my wish has been granted.

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:47.500
Now that I think about it, I never heard your name.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:50.590
It is a fateful meeting.

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:53.630
I knew the second our eyes met.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.760
You are the person with whom I should mate.

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.640
Your feelings, at least, came through loud and clear.

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:01.760
I'm the same.

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:03.630
I never want us to part.

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:37.620
Enough playing tag.

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.370
Don't do anything rash.

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:42.390
Stay calm.

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:47.100
Princess Saki, I have something I need to tell you about this youth.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.050
Please, come here.

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:59.360
Thank you, Princess.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:04.530
We will not be split apart, no matter what you might try!

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:07.360
Keep telling yourself that nonsense in your dreams, you brat!

00:22:07.730 --> 00:22:10.580
You're a girl, ain't you!?

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:27.590
Are you ready?

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:38.100
Do not fear 'The Now' searching for something that can't be seen across this infinite distance

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:52.320
Under the hundred million glittering lights, I found you searching for your dream

00:22:52.320 --> 00:23:01.080
An infinite world filled with glass shards

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:13.140
Growing up I felt I knew many meaningless things

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:20.600
Shining like a jewel, you soar in the sky, no past, no future

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:25.940
The answer is beyond the sky

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:36.450
Do not fear 'The Dream', in a distant
place where truth and lies are unseen

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:52.180
Under the hundred million glittering lights, flowers sway in the wind

00:23:57.230 --> 00:23:58.390
The targeted genes...

00:23:58.390 --> 00:23:59.420
I understand the situation...

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:01.360
I will return to the mothership ahead of schedule.

00:24:01.360 --> 00:24:02.550
I'm a guy!

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:03.570
A guy, damn it!

00:24:03.910 --> 00:24:05.820
What is it like, falling in love with someone?

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:07.240
I feel sorry for her...

00:24:07.490 --> 00:24:08.120
I feel sorry for her... She was crying.

00:24:08.120 --> 00:24:11.130
The Macbac race are not ones to give up so easily.

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:12.790
Pervert! You disgust me!

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:14.790
And that ends that.

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:17.460
Next time: Love me tender.

00:24:18.110 --> 00:24:20.700
I'm waiting for you, my fated person.
